mited\",\"responseMode:judge_formal_answer\"],\"sourceRefs\":[\"dispute:d-4\"]},{\"id\":\"b|d-4|S4|empathy_approach#5\",\"text\":\"재판관님, 지금부터는 제가 한 일을 제 이름으로 적어야 합니다. 생계가 무너지는 공포를 핑계로 선을 넘었습니다.\",\"behaviorHint\":\"스스로를 방어하면서도 상대가 받은 감정을 의식하고 있습니다.\",\"tags\":[\"channel:interrogation\",\"speaker:b\",\"speakerRole:party\",\"listener:judge\",\"listenerRole:judge\",\"address:toJudge\",\"scope:judge_only\",\"revealScope:judge_only\",\"register:formal\",\"honorific:formal\",\"audience:single\",\"tense:present\",\"relationship:headline\",\"judgeAddress:재판관님\",\"judgeAddressState:defined\",\"callTerm:저_리뷰어\",\"callTermState:defined\",\"counterpartyRef:저_리뷰어\",\"counterpartyRefState:defined\",\"mentionTarget:dispute\",\"questionType:empathy_approach\",\"stance:partial\",\"emotion:rattled\",\"continuity:rattled\",\"reveal:partial\",\"revealGuard:open\",\"disclosure:limited\",\"responseMode:judge_formal_answer\"],\"sourceRefs\":[\"dispute:d-4\"]}]},{\"key\":\"b|d-4|S5|fact_pursuit\",\"party\":\"b\",\"disputeId\":\"d-4\",\"lieState\":\"S5\",\"questionType\":\"fact_pursuit\",\"stanceHint\":\"confess\",\"truthLevel\":\"full\",\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"b|d-4|S5|fact_pursuit#1\",\"text\":\"재판관님, 더 돌려 말하지 않겠습니다. 차량 번호와 동선 공유를 직접 올리거나 사실상 용인한 일은 변명하지 않겠습니다. 더는 공익, 생계, 억울함 같은 말 뒤로 숨지 않겠습니다, 그 점은 인정합니다.\",\"behaviorHint\":\"사실선을 붙들며 답변 범위를 통제합니다.\",\"tags\":[\"channel:interrogation\",\"speaker:b\",\"speakerRole:party\",\"listener:judge\",\"listenerRole:judge\",\"address:toJudge\",\"scope:judge_only\",\"revealScope:judge_only\",\"register:formal\",\"honorific:formal\",\"audience:single\",\"tense:present\",\"relationship:headline\",\"judgeAddress:재판관님\",\"judgeAddressState:defined\",\"callTerm:저_리뷰어\",\"callTermState:defined\",\"counterpartyRef:저_리뷰어\",\"counterpartyRefState:defined\",\"mentionTarget:dispute\",\"questionType:fact_pursuit\",\"stance:confess\",\"emotion:resigned\",\"continuity:admission\",\"reveal:full\",\"revealGuard:open\",\"disclosure:open\",\"responseMode:judge_formal_a