th:vague\",\"stance:answer\",\"emotion:cautious\",\"continuity:surface_scope\",\"reveal:hint\",\"revealGuard:strict\",\"disclosure:guarded\",\"responseMode:judge_formal_testimony\"],\"sourceRefs\":[\"witness:tp-1\"]},{\"id\":\"tp-1|vague#3\",\"text\":\"재판관님, 김서우 증인은 그날 분위기와 동선 정도를 먼저 말합니다. 길게 단정하지 않고 기록을 보자고 합니다.\",\"behaviorHint\":\"판단보다 관찰을 앞세웁니다.\",\"tags\":[\"channel:witness\",\"speaker:tp-1\",\"speakerRole:witness\",\"listener:judge\",\"listenerRole:judge\",\"address:toJudge\",\"scope:judge_only\",\"revealScope:judge_only\",\"register:formal\",\"honorific:formal\",\"audience:single\",\"tense:present\",\"relationship:headline\",\"judgeAddress:재판관님\",\"judgeAddressState:defined\",\"callTerm:재판관님\",\"callTermState:defined\",\"counterpartyRef:강민호_씨_사장님\",\"counterpartyRefState:defined\",\"mentionTarget:witness_scope\",\"depth:vague\",\"stance:answer\",\"emotion:cautious\",\"continuity:surface_scope\",\"reveal:hint\",\"revealGuard:strict\",\"disclosure:guarded\",\"responseMode:judge_formal_testimony\"],\"sourceRefs\":[\"witness:tp-1\"]}]},{\"key\":\"tp-1|partial\",\"witnessId\":\"tp-1\",\"depth\":\"partial\",\"stanceHint\":\"answer\",\"truthLevel\":\"partial\",\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"tp-1|partial#1\",\"text\":\"재판관님, 김서우 증인은 촬영 당일 주방과 홀의 분위기, 사장의 분노, 영상 공개 후 직원들에게 내려온 대응 지시를 알고 있습니다. 다만 자기 위치에서 본 구간만 확실하다고 선을 긋습니다.\",\"behaviorHint\":\"기억난 장면부터 차례로 정리합니다.\",\"tags\":[\"channel:witness\",\"speaker:tp-1\",\"speakerRole:witness\",\"listener:judge\",\"listenerRole:judge\",\"address:toJudge\",\"scope:judge_only\",\"revealScope:judge_only\",\"register:formal\",\"honorific:formal\",\"audience:single\",\"tense:present\",\"relationship:headline\",\"judgeAddress:재판관님\",\"judgeAddressState:defined\",\"callTerm:재판관님\",\"callTermState:defined\",\"counterpartyRef:강민호_씨_사장님\",\"counterpartyRefState:defined\",\"mentionTarget:witness_scope\",\"depth:partial\",\"stance:answer\",\"emotion:controlled\",\"continuity:mixed_scope\",\"reveal:partial\",\"revealGuard:buffered\",\"disclosure: